# Design System

## Philosophy

Premium, modern, minimal, professional, government-ready, accessible, responsive, high-performance. Communicate trust immediately.

Avoid flashy gradients, unnecessary glassmorphism, and clutter. Every spacing, animation, and color must have purpose.

## Colors

| Token | Value | Use |
|-------|-------|-----|
| Primary | `#2563EB` | CTAs, links, active states |
| Success | `#16A34A` | Resolved, verified |
| Warning | `#F59E0B` | Pending, medium priority |
| Critical | `#DC2626` | Emergency, urgent |
| Background | `#F8FAFC` | Page background (light) |
| Cards | `#FFFFFF` | Card surfaces |
| Dark bg | `#0F172A` | Dark mode background |

## Typography

- Font: **Inter** (`@fontsource/inter`)
- Responsive sizes, consistent spacing (`p-4`, `p-6`, `gap-4`, `space-y-4`)
- Hierarchy: `text-xs` labels → `text-sm` body → `text-lg/xl` headings

## Layout

**Desktop:** left nav + center feed + right insights
**Mobile:** single feed + bottom nav + floating report button
**Theme:** light default; dark via `data-theme="dark"` on `<html>`

## Shared Components (`client/src/components/ui/`)

`Button`, `Card`, `Badge`, `Skeleton`, `Avatar` — extend here before creating one-offs.

## Left Nav Items

Logo, Home, Community Feed, Report Issue, Civic Map, Track Complaint, AI Intelligence, Notifications, Help, Admin

## Avoid

```jsx
// ❌ Gradient CTAs, glassmorphism, glow shadows
className="bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 backdrop-blur-md shadow-teal-500/25"

// ✅ Clean, purposeful
className="bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white rounded-xl"
```
